ああ まだ終わらない旅路なんだ
Ah, this journey is far from over.

9
00:15:28,424 --> 00:15:32,424
いつか 思いは形になる
Someday, our feelings will take shape.

10
00:15:32,524 --> 00:15:35,924
この真っ白に染まる朝
On this morning dyed in pure white,

11
00:15:36,124 --> 00:15:41,424
忘れられないまま 宝
still unforgettable, a treasure.

12
00:15:41,624 --> 00:15:45,624
諦めてしまうほど この先たくさんの
So much that we might feel like giving up,

13
00:15:48,124 --> 00:15:51,124
もう迷いはしないよ
I won't hesitate anymore.

14
00:15:53,024 --> 00:15:56,924
掛け替えのないもの 溢れてしまうよ
Things irreplaceable overflow.

15
00:15:57,124 --> 00:16:01,824
答えは君のその手の中に 離さないで
The answer is in your hands, don't let it go.

16
00:16:02,024 --> 00:16:06,424
物語は一歩前へ
The story takes a step forward.

17
00:16:06,924 --> 00:16:11,224
諦めてしまうほど この先たくさんの
So much that we might feel like giving up,

18
00:16:11,424 --> 00:16:14,124
後悔が君を待ってるけど
many regrets may await you, but

19
00:16:14,124 --> 00:16:16,924
もう迷いはしないよ
I won't hesitate anymore.

20
00:16:16,924 --> 00:16:21,924
この傷も愛しく思えてしまうほど
So much that even these wounds feel precious,

21
00:16:22,124 --> 00:16:26,124
流されてしまうよ 不格好なままでいいから
we'll get swept away—it's okay to stay clumsy,

22
00:16:26,124 --> 00:16:28,424
走れ その歩幅で
so run at your own pace.

23
00:16:28,424 --> 00:16:31,124
走れ 声を届かせてくれ
Run, let your voice reach us!

24
00:16:31,124 --> 00:16:36,124
期待と不安を同じくらい抱きしめて
Embracing both expectation and anxiety in equal measure,

25
00:16:36,324 --> 00:16:40,124
知った今を 紡ぐ未来 照らして
illuminate the future spun from the present we've learned.

26
00:17:07,424 --> 00:17:10,124
ありがとー！
Thank you~!

27
00:17:10,824 --> 00:17:12,624
改めておめでとう！
Congratulations once again!

28
00:17:12,624 --> 00:17:15,124
ありがとうー！
Thank you~!

29
00:17:15,424 --> 00:17:18,624
待って、そういえば自己紹介してなくね？
Wait, come to think of it, didn't we forget to introduce ourselves?

30
00:17:18,624 --> 00:17:22,424
あ、確かに。誰ですか？
Oh, you're right. Who are you guys?

31
00:17:22,624 --> 00:17:27,824
はい！可愛い、ポジティブ、ジーニアス！奏の女1号、一条莉々華でーす！
Yes! Cute, positive, genius! Kanade's number one woman, Ichijou Ririka!

32
00:17:28,124 --> 00:17:33,124
イェーイ！奏の女って...奏の女～？
Yay! "Kanade's woman"...? Kanade's woman~?

33
00:17:33,124 --> 00:17:35,624
はい、ポンポンポン、退き退き始めー。
All right, chop chop, make way for Hajime~

34
00:17:35,624 --> 00:17:38,424
えー、奏のお姉ちゃん？
Uh, Kanade's big sister?

35
00:17:38,424 --> 00:17:40,124
嘘つけー！
Liar!

36
00:17:40,124 --> 00:17:43,124
これ絶対言おうと思ってたんだわ、どう考えても。
I was totally determined to say that, no matter what.

37
00:17:43,124 --> 00:17:48,124
はい！ReGLOSSの儒烏風亭らでんでございまーす！
Yes! I am Juufuutei Raden from ReGLOSS!

38
00:17:48,124 --> 00:17:52,124
えー、音乃瀬奏の...え、コーチ？
Uh, Otonose Kanade's... wait, coach?

39
00:17:52,124 --> 00:17:54,124
コーチ？！何教えたの？！
Coach?! What did you even teach me?!

40
00:17:54,124 --> 00:17:57,124
何だっけ？教わった記憶ないんで...
What was it? I don't recall being taught anything...

41
00:17:57,124 --> 00:17:58,624
見ないで！
Don't look at me!

42
00:17:58,624 --> 00:18:01,824
こっちがコーチな、それ！
I'm the coach here, hello?!

43
00:18:02,124 --> 00:18:06,624
はい！ということで、ReGLOSSのみんな来てくれてありがとうー！
All right! With that said, thank you so much for coming, ReGLOSS!

44
00:18:06,624 --> 00:18:10,124
ともかく歌いたかったんだー！
I just really wanted to sing this with you all!

45
00:18:10,124 --> 00:18:14,124
嬉しいー！めっちゃいい曲！
We're so glad! It's such a great song!

46
00:18:14,124 --> 00:18:18,624
次はゲストパートなんだけど、一緒にコールお願いしてもいいかな？
Next is the guest segment—could you help me call them in?

47
00:18:18,624 --> 00:18:20,124
もちろん！
Of course!

48
00:18:20,124 --> 00:18:22,124
じゃあ行くよー、せーのっ！
All right, here we go! Ready, set...

49
00:18:22,124 --> 00:18:24,124
どうぞーー！
Come on in~~!

50
00:18:33,824 --> 00:18:39,024
ねえ 考えなくてもいいよ 口先ばかり愛ないの
Hey, you don't even have to think about it; is it just lip service, with no love?

51
00:18:39,024 --> 00:18:43,824
この音にもう酔おうよ 忘れないでいたいよ
Let's just get drunk on this sound; I want to never forget it.

52
