奏（かなで）
[Title: Kanade]

117
00:24:02,672 --> 00:24:07,672
改札の前 つないだ手と手
In front of the ticket gate, our hands held tight,

118
00:24:07,672 --> 00:24:12,972
いつものざわめき 新しい風
amid the usual bustling noise and a fresh new breeze.

119
00:24:12,972 --> 00:24:19,672
明るく見送るはずだったのに
I was supposed to see you off with a cheerful smile,

120
00:24:19,672 --> 00:24:26,772
うまく笑えずに 君を見ていた
but unable to smile properly, I just stared at you.

121
00:24:26,772 --> 00:24:32,672
君が大人になってく その季節が
As the season turns and you grow into an adult,

122
00:24:32,672 --> 00:24:38,472
悲しい歌で 溢れないように
so that it won't overflow with sorrowful songs,

123
00:24:38,472 --> 00:24:44,872
最後に何か 君に伝えたくて
wanting to tell you something one last time,

124
00:24:44,872 --> 00:24:54,272
「さよなら」に代わる言葉を 僕は探してた
I searched for words to say in place of "goodbye."

125
00:24:57,672 --> 00:25:00,872
君の手を引く...
Taking your hand...

126
00:25:00,887 --> 00:25:04,087
もう それぞれの役目が
I used to think our separate roles...

127
00:25:04,087 --> 00:25:07,387
僕らの使命だなんて
...were our only destiny,

128
00:25:07,487 --> 00:25:13,187
そう思ってた だけど今 わかったんだ
but now I finally understand.

129
00:25:13,387 --> 00:25:16,087
僕らならもう
For the two of us,

130
00:25:16,387 --> 00:25:19,087
重ねた日々が ほら
look, the days we built together...

131
00:25:19,287 --> 00:25:23,387
導いてくれる
...will guide us forward.

132
00:25:24,487 --> 00:25:30,087
君が大人になってく その時間が
As the time of you growing up...

133
00:25:30,387 --> 00:25:36,387
降り積もる間に 僕も変わってく
...accumulates, I will change too.

134
00:25:36,687 --> 00:25:42,387
たとえばそこに こんな歌があれば
If only a song like this could be there with us,

135
00:25:42,687 --> 00:25:47,387
ふたりはいつも どんな時も
then the two of us, always and anytime,

136
00:25:47,687 --> 00:25:51,087
つながっていける
...can remain connected.

137
00:26:19,887 --> 00:26:22,487
突然ふいに
Suddenly and unexpectedly,

138
00:26:22,687 --> 00:26:25,887
鳴り響くベルの音
...the sound of the bell rings out.

139
00:26:26,087 --> 00:26:28,887
焦る僕 解ける手
Panicked, our hands come undone,

140
00:26:29,087 --> 00:26:32,087
離れてく君
...and you drift away.

141
00:26:32,387 --> 00:26:37,887
夢中で呼び止めて 抱きしめたんだ
Desperately, I called you back and held you tight.

142
00:26:38,187 --> 00:26:41,387
君がどこに行ったって
No matter where you go,

143
00:26:41,587 --> 00:26:45,387
僕の声で守るよ
I'll protect you with my voice.

144
00:26:48,687 --> 00:26:54,687
君が僕の前に現れた日から
From the day you first appeared before me,

145
00:26:54,887 --> 00:27:00,887
何もかもが違く見えたんだ
...everything began to look different.

146
00:27:01,387 --> 00:27:06,887
朝も 光も 涙も 歌う声も
The morning, the light, the tears, and my singing voice...

147
00:27:07,187 --> 00:27:13,387
君が輝きをくれたんだ
...you gave brilliance to them all.

148
00:27:13,887 --> 00:27:19,387
抑えきれない思いを この声に乗せて
Carrying these uncontrollable feelings on my voice,

149
00:27:19,887 --> 00:27:25,687
遠く君の街へ届けよう
I'll send them far away to your town.

150
00:27:25,887 --> 00:27:31,687
たとえばそれが こんな歌だったら
If it could be a song like this,

151
00:27:31,687 --> 00:27:36,687
僕らは何処にいたとしても
...then wherever we may be,

152
00:27:36,887 --> 00:27:40,887
つながっていける
...we can remain connected.

153
00:27:41,387 --> 00:27:43,887
うー うー
Ooh, ooh...

154
00:27:44,087 --> 00:27:47,087
Woah woah woah...

