00:41:47,391 --> 00:41:52,291
何十年 何百年 昔の光が
a light from tens, hundreds of years ago,

325
00:41:52,391 --> 00:41:57,291
僕自身も忘れた頃に
by the time even I myself have forgotten,

326
00:41:57,391 --> 00:42:02,091
僕らを照らしてる
it illuminates us.

327
00:42:02,191 --> 00:42:05,791
僕ら見つけ合って 手繰り合って
We found each other, pulling each other close,

328
00:42:05,791 --> 00:42:09,391
同じ空 輝くの
shining under the same sky,

329
00:42:09,391 --> 00:42:12,791
だって二人だって 約束した
'cause that's what we promised together.

330
00:42:12,891 --> 00:42:18,191
遥か遠く 終わらないベテルギウス
Far and away, the never-ending Betelgeuse,

331
00:42:18,191 --> 00:42:23,491
誰かに繋ぐ魔法
magic connecting someone to another.

332
00:42:23,891 --> 00:42:29,291
どこまで いつまで 生きられるか
How far, until when, can we keep on living?

333
00:42:29,391 --> 00:42:33,991
君が不安になる度に 強がるんだ
Whenever you feel anxious, I put on a brave face:

334
00:42:34,091 --> 00:42:39,691
大丈夫 僕が横にいるよ
"It's okay, I'm right here beside you."

335
00:42:39,791 --> 00:42:44,991
見えない線を繋ごう
Let's connect the invisible lines.

336
00:42:45,141 --> 00:42:48,791
僕ら見つけ合って 手繰り合って
We found each other, pulling each other close,

337
00:42:48,791 --> 00:42:52,391
同じ空 輝くの
shining under the same sky,

338
00:42:52,391 --> 00:42:55,791
だって二人だって 約束した
'cause that's what we promised together.

339
00:42:55,891 --> 00:43:01,091
遥か遠く 終わらないベテルギウス
Far and away, the never-ending Betelgeuse,

340
00:43:01,191 --> 00:43:06,291
誰かに繋ぐ魔法
magic connecting someone to another.

341
00:43:06,391 --> 00:43:12,091
僕ら肩並べて 手取り合って 進んでく
Shoulder to shoulder, holding hands, we move forward.

342
00:43:12,191 --> 00:43:17,191
辛い時だって 泣かないって 誓っただろう
We swore we wouldn't cry, even in tough times, right?

343
00:43:17,291 --> 00:43:22,491
遥か遠く 終わらないベテルギウス
Far and away, the never-ending Betelgeuse,

344
00:43:22,591 --> 00:43:26,491
君にも見えるだろう
You can see it too, can't you?

345
00:43:26,591 --> 00:43:31,091
祈りが
Our prayer...

346
00:43:31,491 --> 00:43:35,991
空にある何かを見つめてたら
As I stared up at something in the sky,

347
00:43:36,091 --> 00:43:41,691
それは星だって君が教えてくれた
you told me they were stars.

348
00:44:08,591 --> 00:44:13,891
アカシア
[Song: Acacia]

349
00:44:21,891 --> 00:44:25,291
透明よりも綺麗な
That brilliance, clearer than transparent—

350
00:44:25,291 --> 00:44:28,891
あの輝きを確かめにいこう
let's go see it for ourselves.

351
00:44:28,991 --> 00:44:32,291
そうやって始まったんだよ
That's how it all began,

352
00:44:32,291 --> 00:44:35,891
たまに忘れるほど強い理由
with a reason so strong we sometimes forget.

353
00:44:35,991 --> 00:44:39,091
冷たい雨に濡れる時は
When we get soaked in the freezing rain,

354
00:44:39,091 --> 00:44:42,391
足音比べ 騒ぎながらいこう
let's compare our footsteps and make some noise as we go.

355
00:44:42,491 --> 00:44:45,891
太陽の代わりに歌を
Instead of the sun, let's sing a song

356
00:44:45,891 --> 00:44:49,291
君と僕と世界の声で
with your voice, my voice, and the voice of the world.

357
00:44:49,391 --> 00:44:52,691
いつか君を見つけた時に
Back when I first found you,

358
00:44:52,691 --> 00:44:55,891
君に僕も見つけてもらったんだな
you found me too, didn't you?

359
00:44:55,991 --> 00:44:59,491
今 目が合えば笑うだけさ
Now, if our eyes meet, we just smile

360
00:44:59,491 --> 00:45:02,091
言葉の外側で
beyond any words.

361
00:45:02,799 --> 00:45:05,999
ゴールはきっとまだだけど
The goal is surely still far off, but

362
00:45:05,999 --> 00:45:09,299
もう死ぬまで居たい場所にいる
I'm already where I want to stay until I die.

363
00:45:09,299 --> 00:45:11,099
隣で
By your side...

364
00:45:11,099 --> 00:45:13,299
君の側で
...right beside you,

365
00:45:13,299 --> 00:45:16,299
魂がここだよって叫ぶ
my soul shouts, "I am right here!"

366
00:45:16,299 --> 00:45:19,599
泣いたり笑ったりする時
When crying or laughing,

367
00:45:19,599 --> 00:45:23,299
君の命が揺れる時
when your life trembles,

368
00:45:23,299 --> 00:45:26,499
誰より 特等席で
closer than anyone, in the front row seat,

369
00:45:26,499 --> 00:45:30,799
僕も同じように 息をしていたい
I want to be breathing just like you.

370
00:45:32,599 --> 00:45:36,799
Oh yeah, yeah, aha

371
00:45:37,299 --> 00:45:40,799
君の一歩は僕より遠い
Your single step reaches farther than mine;

372
00:45:40,799 --> 00:45:44,299
間違いなく君の凄いところ
that's without a doubt what makes you amazing.

373
00:45:44,299 --> 00:45:47,599
足跡は僕の方が多い
I have left behind more footprints;

374
00:45:47,599 --> 00:45:51,299
間違いなく僕の凄いところ
that's without a doubt what makes me amazing.

375
00:45:51,299 --> 00:45:54,599
真っ暗闇が怖い時は
When the pitch darkness is frightening,

376
00:45:54,599 --> 00:45:57,999
怖さを比べ ふざけながら行こう
let's compare our fears and joke around as we go.

377
00:45:57,999 --> 00:46:01,299
太陽がなくたって歩ける
We can walk even without the sun,

378
00:46:01,299 --> 00:46:04,799
君と照らす世界が見える
I can see the world we illuminate together.

379
00:46:04,799 --> 00:46:08,299
言えない事 聞かないままで
Leaving unspoken things unasked,

380
00:46:08,299 --> 00:46:11,799
消えない傷の事 知らないままで
leaving unhealing wounds unknown,

381
00:46:11,799 --> 00:46:15,099
でも目が合えば笑えるのさ
yet if our eyes meet, we can smile,

382
00:46:15,099 --> 00:46:18,299
涙を挟んでも
even through our tears.

383
00:46:18,299 --> 00:46:21,599
転んだら手を貸してもらうよりも
Rather than having a hand lent to me when I fall,

384
00:46:21,599 --> 00:46:24,799
優しい言葉 選んでもらうよりも
rather than having kind words chosen for me,

385
00:46:24,799 --> 00:46:26,799
隣で
by your side...

386
00:46:26,799 --> 00:46:31,299
信じて欲しいんだ どこまでも一緒に行けると
...I want you to believe we can go anywhere together.

387
00:46:31,599 --> 00:46:34,999
ついに辿り着くその時
When we finally arrive at that moment,

388
00:46:34,999 --> 00:46:38,599
夢の正体に触れる時
when we touch the reality of our dream,

389
00:46:38,599 --> 00:46:41,299
必ず 一番側で
always, right by your side,

390
00:46:41,299 --> 00:46:46,299
君の目に映る 景色に居たい
I want to be in the scenery reflected in your eyes.

391
00:46:57,599 --> 00:47:00,799
あの輝きを
That brilliance...

392
00:47:00,799 --> 00:47:04,599
君に会えたから見えた
...I could see because I met you.

393
00:47:04,599 --> 00:47:09,299
あの輝きを 確かめに行こう
Let's go see that brilliance for ourselves!

394
00:47:09,299 --> 00:47:12,799
Oh yeah, yeah, aha

395
00:47:12,799 --> 00:47:16,299
どんな最後が待っていようと
No matter what kind of end awaits,

396
00:47:16,299 --> 00:47:19,799
もう離せない手を繋いだよ
I've held your hand, which I will never let go.

397
00:47:19,799 --> 00:47:23,299
隣で 隣で 君の側で
By your side, by your side, right beside you,

398
00:47:23,299 --> 00:47:26,799
魂がここだよって叫ぶ
my soul shouts, "I am right here!"

399
00:47:26,799 --> 00:47:30,299
そして理由が光る時
And when that purpose shines bright,

400
00:47:30,299 --> 00:47:33,599
僕らを理由が抱きしめる時
when that purpose embraces us,

401
00:47:33,599 --> 00:47:36,799
誰より近くで 特等席で
closer than anyone, in the front row seat,

402
00:47:36,799 --> 00:47:40,799
僕の見た君を 君に伝えたい
I want to tell you about the "you" I saw.

403
00:47:43,299 --> 00:47:48,799
君がいることを 君に伝えたい
I want to tell you that you are here.

404
00:47:50,599 --> 00:47:54,299
そうやって始まったんだよ
That's how it all began.

405
00:47:57,299 --> 00:48:00,999
そうやって始まったんだよ
That's how it all began.

406
00:48:03,599 --> 00:48:07,799
Oh yeah, yeah, aha

407
00:48:21,799 --> 00:48:24,599
わー！ママたちー！
Wow! Mamas!

408
00:48:24,599 --> 00:48:26,299
奏ちゃん！
Kanade-chan!

409
00:48:26,299 --> 00:48:28,599
ママたちー！
Mamas!

410
00:48:28,599 --> 00:48:29,999
お誕生日…
Happy...

411
00:48:29,999 --> 00:48:32,599
おめでとー！
...Birthday!

412
00:48:32,599 --> 00:48:35,299
わー！ありがとうー！
Waa! Thank you!

413
00:48:35,299 --> 00:48:39,299
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

414
00:48:39,299 --> 00:48:41,299
騒がしいな
You're so noisy!

415
00:48:41,299 --> 00:48:43,599
お前に言われたくねぇよ
I don't wanna hear that from you!

416
00:48:43,599 --> 00:48:44,599
確かに！
Fair point!

417
00:48:44,599 --> 00:48:46,999
奏ちゃんが一番キャッキャしてんじゃない？
Isn't Kanade-chan the one who's most hyper?

418
00:48:46,999 --> 00:48:49,299
そうですよ！だって誕生日だから！
That's right! Because it's my birthday!

419
00:48:49,299 --> 00:48:50,599
そうだね！
That's true!

420
00:48:50,599 --> 00:48:54,299
お母さんたち、産んでくれてありがとうございます！
Mothers, thank you for giving birth to me!

421
00:48:54,299 --> 00:48:56,599
産んではない！産んではない！
We didn't give birth to you! We didn't!

422
00:48:56,599 --> 00:48:57,799
誤解を生む！
You'll cause misunderstandings!

423
00:48:57,599 --> 00:48:58,599
こちらこそ！
Same to you!

424
00:48:58,599 --> 00:48:59,799
こちらこそじゃないよ！
What do you mean "Same to you"?!

425
00:48:59,599 --> 00:49:01,299
とんでもないことやめて
Don't say outrageous things like that!

426
00:49:00,999 --> 00:49:02,799
朝から誤解生んじゃうから
You're gonna cause misunderstandings first thing in the morning!

427
00:49:02,799 --> 00:49:04,599
産んでません！産んでませんから！
They didn't give birth to me! They really didn't!

428
00:49:04,599 --> 00:49:05,999
ママですけどね。
Though we are your mamas.

429
00:49:05,999 --> 00:49:07,799
ママですけど産んでません。
We're your mamas, but we didn't give birth to you.

430
00:49:07,799 --> 00:49:08,799
はい！
Right!

431
00:49:08,599 --> 00:49:09,599
はい！
Right!

432
00:49:09,299 --> 00:49:11,799
そして、今日は何を話すんですか？ここから。
And so, what are we talking about from here?

433
00:49:11,799 --> 00:49:16,299
そうですね。えーっと、これまでのコラボでの感想など…
Well, um, our thoughts on our past collabs together...

434
00:49:16,299 --> 00:49:17,799
めっちゃ…
That's so...

435
00:49:17,599 --> 00:49:18,999
雑じゃね？
Isn't that super vague?

436
00:49:18,799 --> 00:49:20,599
雑じゃねーのかな？
A bit too casual, don't you think?

437
00:49:20,299 --> 00:49:21,599
大丈夫かな？
Is that gonna be okay?

438
00:49:21,299 --> 00:49:23,299
言うて、言うて…
I mean, I mean...

439
00:49:23,299 --> 00:49:26,299
じゃあ一番印象深かったの何？奏ちゃんが。
Then which one left the deepest impression on you, Kanade-chan?

440
00:49:25,999 --> 00:49:27,299
そうだよ。気になる。
Yeah, I'm curious.

441
00:49:27,299 --> 00:49:28,299
ね。
Right?

442
00:49:27,999 --> 00:49:32,799
でもある言うて、こう「ママず」でやったコラボって実は一個しかない。
But to be honest, the collabs we did as "Mamas" is actually just one!

443
00:49:32,799 --> 00:49:34,599
あー！
Ah!

444
00:49:34,599 --> 00:49:35,999
懐かしい！アレだな！
So nostalgic! That one, right!

445
00:49:35,799 --> 00:49:37,799
確かに、あん時なー！
Indeed, that time!

446
00:49:37,799 --> 00:49:41,599
あれ？でもそういえば、なんか赤い髪の毛の人…
Huh? But come to think of it, that person with red hair...

447
00:49:41,599 --> 00:49:42,799
あれ！？
Huh?!

448
00:49:42,599 --> 00:49:43,999
あれ？いないね。
Wait, she's not here.

449
00:49:43,999 --> 00:49:46,999
やっぱりアレじゃない？産んだとか言う…
Isn't it because of that? You saying she gave birth...

450
00:49:46,999 --> 00:49:48,599
あれだね！
That must be it!

451
00:49:48,599 --> 00:49:50,299
来てないのは…
The reason she didn't come...

452
00:49:50,299 --> 00:49:53,799
あ、でも、なんか書いてある。あ、でもなんかスケジュール的に…
Ah, but something's written here. Ah, because of her schedule...

453
00:49:53,599 --> 00:49:54,999
あ、そうだった！
Oh, that's right!

454
00:49:54,599 --> 00:49:55,999
あ、そうでした。
Ah, that's right.

455
00:49:55,799 --> 00:49:56,799
なるほどね。
I see.

456
00:49:56,599 --> 00:49:59,799
一応聞いてみたんですけど、ちょっと都合が合わなく…
I did ask her, but our schedules didn't match up...

457
00:49:59,299 --> 00:50:00,599
あ、そうでした。
Ah, I see.

458
00:50:00,447 --> 00:50:02,747
じゃ次はね、みんなでできるといいねー
Next time, it'd be great if we could all do it together!

459
00:50:02,747 --> 00:50:05,047
コラボとかもしようね！ / しようね。
Let's do a collab too! / Yeah, let's!

460
00:50:05,047 --> 00:50:07,447
したい、したい！ / したい！
I'd love to! / Me too!

461
00:50:07,447 --> 00:50:09,747
イェーイ！
Yay!

462
00:50:09,747 --> 00:50:12,647
あの、ゲームコラボ以来ですからねー。
After all, we haven't done one since our game collab.

463
00:50:12,647 --> 00:50:15,047
そうだねー。 / そうねー。
That's true. / Yeah.

464
00:50:15,047 --> 00:50:17,847
はい、えーっと... / はい、次、次、次、次、次！
Yes, um... / Alright, next, next, next, next, next!

465
00:50:17,847 --> 00:50:20,947
次ある？ / よいしょ、よいしょ... / 衣装、衣装、衣装、衣装！
Is there a next? / Alright... / Outfits, outfits, outfits!

466
00:50:20,947 --> 00:50:22,947
衣装だ！そうだね！
Outfits! That's right!

467
00:50:22,947 --> 00:50:28,447
えーっと、そうですね。衣装の変化から言っていきますと、まずスバル先輩...
Well, let's see. If we talk about outfit changes, first, Subaru-senpai...

468
00:50:28,447 --> 00:50:31,247
あ、これスバルたちが言うんじゃないの？！
Wait, aren't we the ones supposed to talk about it?!

469
00:50:31,247 --> 00:50:34,947
なんで奏が何が変わったか言うの？！
Why is Kanade the one explaining what changed?!

470
00:50:35,947 --> 00:50:38,647
そっちか！ / そっち！ / はい、あ、あ、あ...
Oh, that way?! / That way! / Okay, ah, um...

471
00:50:39,147 --> 00:50:43,447
え、じゃ聞きたい... / あ、言っていい？どっちから言う？ / どっち？
Then I want to hear... / Can we say it? Who goes first? / Who?

472
00:50:43,447 --> 00:50:46,947
え、どっちにしようかな？じゃ目をつむって... こっち！
Hmm, which one should I pick? Let me close my eyes... This one!

473
00:50:46,947 --> 00:50:48,447
あ、じゃあスバちゃんから。
Ah, then from Suba-chan.

474
00:50:48,447 --> 00:50:50,447
いや、こっち、こっちはスバルなんだ！
Wait, "this one"... "this one" is me?!

475
00:50:50,447 --> 00:50:55,047
奏は、最初は、なんかARKで騒いでるの見て...
With Kanade, at first, I saw her causing chaos in ARK...

476
00:50:55,047 --> 00:50:58,247
「なんだこいつ」と思って... / 「なんだこいつ？！」
...and thought, "Who is this kid?!" / "Who is this kid?!"

477
00:50:58,247 --> 00:51:06,247
でも、ARKであの声が貫通してる頃から、ホロライブメンバーの中では「奏は大丈夫だな」っていう...
But back in ARK, when her voice pierced through everything, among the Holo members I felt, "Kanade's gonna be just fine."

478
00:51:06,447 --> 00:51:11,247
大丈夫だな？ / 強い！ / 「こいつは大丈夫だ」っていう... / 元気だった！
Just fine? / Strong! / "She'll be just fine..." / I was full of energy!

479
00:51:11,247 --> 00:51:13,647
なんか元気さがあったんですよ。でもね...
She just had that energy. But you know...

480
00:51:13,647 --> 00:51:18,447
GTAで最後ね、奏ちゃんがね、逮捕した... もうその顔やめろ、お前！
At the end of GTA, Kanade... arrested... Stop making that face, you!

481
00:51:18,447 --> 00:51:21,447
近いねん！
You're too close!

482
00:51:21,447 --> 00:51:26,947
で、なんか逮捕されたりとかね、そのあと奏ちゃん実はね、「私もっと頑張りたいです」って電話してきたりとかね...
And after being arrested and all, Kanade actually called me later saying, "I want to work even harder!"

483
00:51:26,947 --> 00:51:29,947
え、ちょ、それ言っちゃう？！ / えー！
Wait, you're revealing that?! / Aww!

484
00:51:29,947 --> 00:51:32,247
だからね、バラしちゃうよ！ / バラしちゃう！
That's why I'm spilling it! / She spilled it!

485
00:51:32,247 --> 00:51:36,947
頑張り屋さんなんだなって思いました！おめでとう！ / 頑張り屋さん！ありがとう！
I realized she's such a hard worker! Happy birthday! / Hard worker! Thank you!

486
00:51:36,947 --> 00:51:39,947
さ、そして次は？団長ね。 / 次は！ / 次は！
Alright, who's next? Danchou! / Next! / Next!

487
00:51:39,947 --> 00:51:44,947
いや、奏ちゃんはね、最初デビューした時さ、すごい歌もうまくてね...
Well, when Kanade first debuted, she sang so well...

488
00:51:44,947 --> 00:51:50,447
団長とは、なんか、別の世界の人間なんだなと思って全然絡めなかったけど...
I thought she was someone from a whole different world, so I couldn't really interact with her at all.

489
00:51:50,447 --> 00:51:54,447
や、でもね、あの、マイクラでね、覚えてる？あのダイヤをね、団長から...
But you know, in Minecraft, remember? When you, from Danchou...

490
00:51:54,447 --> 00:51:57,947
あの、嘘ついてね、取ったりとか...
...told a lie and took my diamonds...

491
00:51:57,947 --> 00:52:01,447
いや、そっから「あ、この子はそういう子なんだ」って...
From that point on, I was like, "Ah, she's that kind of girl!"

492
00:52:01,447 --> 00:52:06,947
ダイヤ、ダイヤ嘘ついて盗むようなやつだったの？！
You were the kind of person who lies to steal diamonds?!

493
00:52:06,947 --> 00:52:13,947
違うの！こんなの団長にもこうやって物怖じせずに絡んできてくれたり、もう本当かわいいの！
No! Being able to tease even Danchou like that without hesitation, she's just so adorable!

494
00:52:13,947 --> 00:52:17,947
めっちゃそれノエルママだったら何でも許してくれる...
If it's Noel-mama, she'll forgive anything...

495
00:52:17,947 --> 00:52:19,947
いや、もう許しちゃう！
Yeah, I'll totally forgive it!

496
00:52:19,947 --> 00:52:22,247
いや、駄目だろ！ダイヤカツアゲすんのは！
No, that's not okay! Extorting diamonds is wrong!

497
00:52:22,247 --> 00:52:24,447
いい子、いい子！だから今では...
Good girl, good girl! So nowadays...

498
00:52:24,447 --> 00:52:26,947
ねえ、どんどん後ろ行くのやめて！
Hey, stop backing away like that!

499
00:52:26,947 --> 00:52:29,447
今ではね、本当にいい子ですし。 / そうだね。
Nowadays, she really is such a good girl. / That's true.

500
00:52:29,447 --> 00:52:33,247
いい子！ / やったー！良かったー！
A good girl! / Yay! I'm so glad!

501
00:52:33,247 --> 00:52:36,947
はい、でも本当におめでとうね、お誕生日！ / おめでとう！ / ありがとう！
Well, seriously, happy birthday! / Congrats! / Thank you!

502
00:52:36,947 --> 00:52:41,247
来てくれてありがとうございます！一緒に歌えて本当に嬉しかったです！
Thank you so much for coming! I was so happy we could sing together!

503
00:52:41,247 --> 00:52:45,247
スバルたちも嬉しかったぞー！ / 嬉しかったー！
We were so happy too! / So happy!

504
00:52:45,447 --> 00:52:51,947
じゃあ、次は... 次、次があるから... / 次があるよね。 / 次があるからね！
Well then, next... because there's a next part... / There's a next part, yeah. / Yeah, next!

505
00:52:51,947 --> 00:52:56,447
めっちゃ台本読むやん！いや、お前だよ！
Look at you reading the script so hard! No, you are!

506
00:52:56,447 --> 00:52:58,647
お前だよ、どこからどう見ても！
It's clearly you, no matter how you look at it!

507
00:52:58,647 --> 00:53:00,647
ちゃんと、ちゃんと読みます！ / うん、ちゃんと読んで。
I'll read it properly! / Yeah, read it properly.

508
00:53:00,647 --> 00:53:07,247
スバル先輩、ノエル先輩、この後奏がなんと生パフォーマンスで1人で頑張るんですけど...
Subaru-senpai, Noel-senpai, next, Kanade is going to perform live all by myself, but...

509
00:53:07,247 --> 00:53:11,247
えー、曲振りしてもらってもいいですか？ / えー！すごい！
Um, could you two introduce the song for me? / Wow, amazing!

510
00:53:11,247 --> 00:53:14,247
いいよー！ / やったー！
Sure! / Yay!

511
00:53:14,247 --> 00:53:17,447
次の曲は？
The next song is?

512
00:53:17,447 --> 00:53:20,947
Beautiful！
Beautiful!

513
00:53:47,447 --> 00:53:52,447
Beautiful
[Song: Beautiful]

514
00:54:06,847 --> 00:54:13,147
遠くに伸びる影 夜の波が消した
The shadows stretching into the distance were erased by the waves of night,

515
00:54:13,147 --> 00:54:19,947
涙を流したなんて 気づかれないまま
without anyone ever noticing that tears were shed.

516
00:54:19,947 --> 00:54:26,947
心を捨てるなら 傷つく方がマシさ
If I have to throw away my heart, I'd rather get hurt;

517
00:54:26,947 --> 00:54:33,647
冷たい風を切って 逃げるように走る
cutting through the chilly wind, I run as if escaping.

518
00:54:33,647 --> 00:54:40,247
いつかこの雫は 宝石になるのでしょう
Someday, these droplets will turn into jewels, won't they?

519
00:54:40,247 --> 00:54:47,947
美しい心に 生まれ変わる そう信じて
They'll be reborn into a beautiful heart, believing that...

520
00:54:47,947 --> 00:54:55,447
世界で一つの 輝く光になれ
Become the one and only shining light in the world.

521
00:54:55,447 --> 00:55:03,447
私でいい 私を信じて 行くのさ 遠くへ
It's okay to be me; believing in myself, I'll go far away.

522
00:55:03,762 --> 00:55:05,562
…んでも まんまるで
...or tumble, stay whole,

523
00:55:05,662 --> 00:55:09,162
寄り道を行け
and take the scenic detour.

524
00:55:09,262 --> 00:55:11,162
あたしでいい
Being myself is enough;

525
00:55:11,262 --> 00:55:16,962
あたしの歩幅で 生きてくのさ
I'll live at my own pace.

526
00:55:21,262 --> 00:55:24,162
誰かを羨むのは
Envying someone else

527
00:55:24,162 --> 00:55:27,462
避けられない心情
is an unavoidable feeling,

528
00:55:27,562 --> 00:55:30,562
誰かを許すのは
and forgiving someone

529
00:55:30,562 --> 00:55:34,262
難しい心情
is a difficult emotion.

530
00:55:34,562 --> 00:55:37,562
無いものを探せば
If I search for what I lack,

531
00:55:37,562 --> 00:55:40,562
数え切れないけれど
there's no end to the list, but...

532
00:55:40,862 --> 00:55:44,562
ゆっくり愛してみよう
I'll try to slowly learn to love

533
00:55:44,562 --> 00:55:49,362
私というこの命を
this life that is uniquely me.

534
00:55:49,862 --> 00:55:52,762
世界で一つの
Become a shining light,

535
00:55:52,762 --> 00:55:56,762
輝く光になれ
the one and only in the world.

536
00:55:56,962 --> 00:56:03,262
明かりのない明日を迎えたとしても
Even if tomorrow greets me without a single light,

537
00:56:03,462 --> 00:56:10,262
悲しみの先に 孤独が押し寄せても
even if loneliness surges in beyond the sorrow,

538
00:56:10,362 --> 00:56:12,362
息をしてる
I am breathing.

539
00:56:12,462 --> 00:56:17,962
今日も息をして 生きている
Breathing today, too, I am alive.

540
00:56:42,562 --> 00:56:48,962
世界で一つの
The one and only in the world...

541
00:56:49,362 --> 00:56:55,262
私に幸あれ
May blessings come to me,

542
00:56:55,762 --> 00:57:01,762
涙に幸あれ
may blessings come to my tears,

543
00:57:02,262 --> 00:57:08,262
明日に幸あれ
may blessings come to tomorrow.

544
00:57:08,662 --> 00:57:11,462
世界で一つの
Become a shining light,

545
00:57:11,462 --> 00:57:16,562
輝く光になれ
the one and only in the world.

546
00:57:16,862 --> 00:57:18,762
泣いてもいい
It's fine to cry;

547
00:57:18,862 --> 00:57:22,562
私を歩いていくのさ
I will walk this path as myself.

548
00:57:22,862 --> 00:57:29,562
涙は頬を流れる星のようさ
Tears are like stars tracing down my cheeks.

549
00:57:29,862 --> 00:57:31,762
私になれ
Become who I am,

550
00:57:31,762 --> 00:57:33,762
私を叶えて
make myself come true,

551
00:57:33,862 --> 00:57:38,262
生きていくのさ
and keep on living.

552
00:57:40,762 --> 00:57:47,262
いつの日も
Always and forever.

553
00:57:53,762 --> 00:57:57,762
いつの日も
Always and forever.

554
00:58:42,662 --> 00:58:44,962
はい！ということで！
All right! With that said,

555
00:58:45,062 --> 00:58:46,762
いかがでしたでしょうか？
how did you all like it?

556
00:58:46,862 --> 00:58:49,762
ちょっとお水だけ飲んできます！
I'm just going to go grab some water!

557
00:58:56,362 --> 00:58:58,962
あー！水うめえ！
Aah! Water tastes so good!

558
00:58:59,262 --> 00:59:00,962
はい！それでは、
All right! And now,

559
00:59:01,062 --> 00:59:03,962
えー、この素晴らしき曲の余韻が消えぬ間に、
before the afterglow of that wonderful song fades,

560
00:59:04,062 --> 00:59:06,962
最後の曲、聴いてください！
please listen to the final song!

561
00:59:07,062 --> 00:59:08,362
はいっ！
Here we go!

562
00:59:16,762 --> 00:59:21,762
目を開けて 口ずさむ 輝ける
Open your eyes, hum along, and shine bright.

563
00:59:21,962 --> 00:59:26,262
“きっと 無敵になる”
"I'll surely become invincible."

564
00:59:28,262 --> 00:59:30,562
【Feel my heart】
[Feel my heart]

565
00:59:30,562 --> 00:59:33,562
【See me become the GREATEST】
[See me become the GREATEST]

566
00:59:33,562 --> 00:59:35,762
【No one can beat me】
[No one can beat me]

567
00:59:35,762 --> 00:59:38,262
【Cuz I'm a GREATEST】
[Cuz I'm a GREATEST]

568
00:59:39,562 --> 00:59:44,562
固く結び直した靴紐が 羽に見えて
The shoelaces I retied tightly look like wings,

569
00:59:44,962 --> 00:59:49,062
どこまででも跳べる予感がする
and I have a feeling I can leap anywhere.

570
00:59:49,462 --> 00:59:54,162
追いかけるなんて趣味じゃない 追い越そう 明日だって
Chasing isn't my style; let's overtake tomorrow too.

571
00:59:54,462 --> 00:59:59,562
夢のまんま終わるほど眠くないわ
I'm not tired enough to let this end as just a dream!

572
01:00:00,517 --> 01:00:02,317
そう 何もかも大丈夫
Yeah, everything will be alright,

573
01:00:02,317 --> 01:00:05,417
奇跡よりも大胆に勝つの
winning even bolder than a miracle.

574
01:00:05,417 --> 01:00:08,217
見たことない景色だって
Even sights I've never seen before

575
01:00:08,217 --> 01:00:12,317
光に満ちていく
are filling up with light.

576
01:00:12,517 --> 01:00:15,117
Wanna be the GREATEST

577
01:00:15,317 --> 01:00:17,817
地図ならばこの胸に
If it's a map, it's in my heart,

578
01:00:17,917 --> 01:00:20,617
ほとばしる熱がある
along with a surging passion.

579
01:00:20,617 --> 01:00:23,217
誰も止められない my way
No one can stop my way.

580
01:00:23,317 --> 01:00:25,717
Wanna be the GREATEST

581
01:00:25,917 --> 01:00:28,717
弱音も重ねればシンフォニー
Layer our weaknesses, and they become a symphony.

582
01:00:28,817 --> 01:00:33,417
強くなれる 歌って
We can become strong, sing it out.

583
01:00:33,617 --> 01:00:39,517
“きっと 無敵になる”
“We'll surely be invincible.”

584
01:00:44,117 --> 01:00:47,817
部屋で一人描いたステージも
Even the stage I imagined alone in my room,

585
01:00:47,917 --> 01:00:50,417
覚えていて 居場所になる
remember it, it will become our place.

586
01:00:50,517 --> 01:00:53,817
声が聞こえてくる
I can hear your voices.

587
01:00:53,917 --> 01:00:56,217
深呼吸をして
Take a deep breath,

588
01:00:56,217 --> 01:00:59,217
飛び乗るぐらいが正攻法だって
leaping right in is the right way to go.

589
01:00:59,317 --> 01:01:03,917
胸を張って踊るのも悪くないわ
Holding my head high and dancing isn't bad at all.

590
01:01:05,217 --> 01:01:07,317
恐れないで 大丈夫
Don't be afraid, it's alright.

591
01:01:07,317 --> 01:01:10,117
唱えるたび 絶対になるの
Every time I say it, it becomes certain.

592
01:01:10,217 --> 01:01:12,617
一度きりの人生だって
Even in this once-in-a-lifetime life,

593
01:01:12,617 --> 01:01:17,117
この手で舵を取れ
take the helm with your own hands.

594
01:01:17,317 --> 01:01:19,917
Wanna be the GREATEST

595
01:01:20,017 --> 01:01:22,717
私が私として
With me staying true to myself,

596
01:01:22,717 --> 01:01:25,217
輝ける道を行く
I will walk a shining path.

597
01:01:25,217 --> 01:01:27,917
声もきらめいて my day
My voice sparkles too, it's my day.

598
01:01:28,017 --> 01:01:30,317
Wanna be the GREATEST

599
01:01:30,317 --> 01:01:33,417
目覚めを奏でてよオーバーチュア
Play an overture to awaken me!

600
01:01:33,517 --> 01:01:38,117
望むほどに叶って
Coming true as much as I desire,

601
01:01:38,317 --> 01:01:44,217
もっと 素敵になる
it'll become even more wonderful.

602
01:02:05,117 --> 01:02:07,017
[Feel my heart]

603
01:02:07,117 --> 01:02:09,917
[See me become the GREATEST]

604
01:02:10,017 --> 01:02:12,217
[No one can beat me]

605
01:02:12,317 --> 01:02:15,117
[Cuz I'm a GREATEST]

606
01:02:15,217 --> 01:02:17,817
Wanna be the GREATEST

607
01:02:17,817 --> 01:02:20,417
諦めた「好き」の数
The passions I once gave up on

608
01:02:20,417 --> 01:02:23,017
上を向く理由がある
are reasons to keep my head up.

609
01:02:23,117 --> 01:02:25,617
涙 導いて my beat
Guide my tears, my beat.

610
01:02:25,717 --> 01:02:28,017
Wanna be the GREATEST

611
01:02:28,117 --> 01:02:31,317
傷跡も連れてアレグロ
Carrying even my scars along, allegro!

612
01:02:31,417 --> 01:02:36,217
強くなれる 歌って
We can become strong, sing it out!

613
01:02:36,317 --> 01:02:41,517
もっと 光射す方へ
Towards where more light shines!

614
01:02:41,617 --> 01:02:47,817
“きっと 無敵になる”
“We'll surely be invincible!”

615
01:02:57,017 --> 01:02:59,117
うわあ！ふう…
Whoa! Whew...

616
01:02:59,217 --> 01:03:01,117
はい！ということで…
All right! So...

617
01:03:01,317 --> 01:03:05,417
今、聴いていたのが…え、違う、聴いていただいていたのが…
what I was listening to just now... wait, no, what you were listening to...

618
01:03:05,617 --> 01:03:09,317
もう完全に力が、え、無くなってしまいました。安心して。
I've completely, um, run out of strength, out of relief.

619
01:03:09,617 --> 01:03:14,117
え、今聴いていただいたのが、なんと奏の初オリ曲！
What you just listened to was Kanade's very first original song!

620
01:03:14,517 --> 01:03:18,317
『GREATEST』でーす！
“GREATEST”!

621
01:03:18,517 --> 01:03:20,617
ふー！
Woohoo!

622
01:03:20,717 --> 01:03:22,917
すごい！ジャケットが…
Look at that! The jacket cover...

623
01:03:23,017 --> 01:03:25,917
え、作詞作曲はナナホシ管弦楽団…
Um, the lyricist and composer is Nanahoshi Orchestra...

624
01:03:25,917 --> 01:03:29,617
かん、噛んじゃった、管弦楽団さんでーす！
Or- I stumbled over my words- Orchestra!

625
01:03:30,317 --> 01:03:34,317
え、こちらの楽曲は、そうですね、どういう楽曲か、えーすごい…
Um, as for this track, well, to describe what kind of song it is...

626
01:03:36,317 --> 01:03:39,317
言うと、がっ…こう、簡単に言うと！
To put it... simply, to put it simply!

627
01:03:39,417 --> 01:03:43,517
え、韓国から夢を叶えに来た奏なりの、こう、
As Kanade, who came from Korea to fulfill her dream, it's like

628
01:03:43,517 --> 01:03:47,817
ギラギラソング、キラキラソングみたいな感じとなって居まして、
a flashy, sparkling kind of song,

629
01:03:47,917 --> 01:03:52,017
奏がこういうのを信じてやっていきたいんだ！みたいなのを伝えて、
and I conveyed how I want to keep going believing in this,

630
01:03:52,017 --> 01:03:55,117
え、書いていただきました！
and they wrote it for me!

631
01:03:55,617 --> 01:03:57,717
すごい、なんて素敵な歌詞を…
It's amazing, such wonderful lyrics...

632
01:03:57,817 --> 01:04:00,517
本当に素敵な楽曲と歌詞をありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for such wonderful music and lyrics!

633
01:04:00,517 --> 01:04:01,817
めっちゃ気に入ってます！
I love it so much!

634
01:04:01,917 --> 01:04:06,017
そして！4月21日0時から、
And! Starting April 21st at midnight,

635
01:04:06,117 --> 01:04:08,817
え、この後おそらく3時…あ、違う、3時間後に、
um, after this, probably at 3- wait, no, in 3 hours,

636
01:04:08,817 --> 01:04:11,517
楽曲リリースもされます！
the song will also be released!

637
01:04:11,617 --> 01:04:14,617
イェーイ！パチパチ！ありがとうー！
Yay! Clap clap! Thank you~!

638
01:04:14,717 --> 01:04:17,717
すごい、最高すぎたわ。ありがとう。
It's amazing, that was so great. Thank you.

639
01:04:17,917 --> 01:04:20,717
MVはね、ちょっと後日公開なんですけれども、
The MV will be released at a later date, though,

640
01:04:20,817 --> 01:04:24,517
ぜひ公開されたらいっぱい見てくださーい！
please watch it a lot once it's out!

641
01:04:24,617 --> 01:04:27,717
はい、新曲の披露もできたところで！
All right, now that I've unveiled my new song,

642
01:04:27,817 --> 01:04:30,017
告知タイムです！
it's announcement time!

643
01:04:30,017 --> 01:04:32,517
まず一つ目は、皆さんお待ちかね、
First up is what you've all been waiting for:

644
01:04:32,517 --> 01:04:35,117
グッズの紹介でーす！
the merchandise lineup!

645
01:04:35,317 --> 01:04:37,017
こちら！
Right here!

646
01:04:37,217 --> 01:04:41,017
音乃瀬奏 誕生日記念2025、
Kanade Otonose Birthday Celebration 2025:

647
01:04:41,117 --> 01:04:44,617
フルセットはこんな感じになってます！可愛いーーー！
Here is the full set! So cute!

648
01:04:44,717 --> 01:04:48,017
可愛いやろ？可愛いやろ？ちょっとコメントにラグがあって拾いづらいんだが、
Cute, right? Cute, right? There's a bit of lag with comments so it's hard to read them, but...

649
01:04:48,117 --> 01:04:51,317
「うおーおめでとう」「最高だったよ」「オリ曲！」
“Whoa, congrats!”, “It was amazing!”, “Original song!”

650
01:04:51,417 --> 01:04:53,817
まだオリ曲のくだりかー！
You're still on the original song topic?!

651
01:04:53,917 --> 01:04:58,117
え、今回のキービジュアルはごんじママに描いていただきましたー！
Um, this key visual was illustrated by Gonji-mama!

652
01:04:58,217 --> 01:04:59,517
可愛いでしょー！
Isn't it adorable?!

653
01:05:00,198 --> 01:05:02,048
まぁでもオリ曲だね！みんなすごい
Still, an original song! You guys are all so—

654
01:05:02,048 --> 01:05:04,698
「念願のオリ曲！」みたいな感じだったから
like, "Finally, an original song!" so...

655
01:05:04,698 --> 01:05:06,798
いっぱい喜んでもらえて嬉しいです！
I'm so glad everyone is so happy about it!

656
01:05:06,798 --> 01:05:09,348
それではグッズ1つずつ見ていきましょう！
Now then, let's take a look at the merch one by one!

657
01:05:10,098 --> 01:05:11,098
1つ目！
First item!

658
01:05:11,098 --> 01:05:13,398
ワイドラバーマットー！
Wide rubber desk mat!

659
01:05:13,398 --> 01:05:17,998
キービジュアルのオリジナルパジャマ着た奏の、きゃー！デザインのラバーマットです！
It's a rubber mat featuring Kanade in original pajamas from the key visual with a "kyaa!" design!

660
01:05:17,998 --> 01:05:22,198
キーボードとマウスを乗せて使える、ワイドサイズになっています！
It's an extra-wide size that fits both your keyboard and mouse!

661
01:05:22,198 --> 01:05:23,898
2つ目はこちら！
Here is the second item!

662
01:05:24,198 --> 01:05:27,298
奏が落書きしちゃったTシャツです！
It's the "T-shirt Kanade doodled on"!

663
01:05:27,298 --> 01:05:30,998
あの、実際に奏がね、描き下ろしデザインのTシャツです！
It's a T-shirt with a design freshly drawn by Kanade herself!

664
01:05:30,998 --> 01:05:32,298
描きましたー！
I drew it!

665
01:05:32,298 --> 01:05:37,498
よかったら奏と一緒に、Tシャツ1枚持ってる民になってくれませんか？
If you'd like, won't you join Kanade in becoming one of the "people who own one T-shirt"?

666
01:05:37,498 --> 01:05:39,798
いっぱい買ってください！
Please buy lots of them!

667
01:05:39,798 --> 01:05:40,998
続いて3つ目！
Next up, the third item!

668
01:05:40,998 --> 01:05:42,698
タンブラーです！
A tumbler!

669
01:05:42,698 --> 01:05:46,998
衣装のね、こちらの面をモチーフにした日常使いができる落ち着いたデザイン！
Featuring the ribbon from my outfit as a motif, it's a subtle design suitable for daily use!

670
01:05:46,998 --> 01:05:50,998
会社などで使って、ぜひとも奏を宣伝してください！
Please use it at work or elsewhere, and spread the word about Kanade!

671
01:05:50,998 --> 01:05:52,698
そして次はこちら！
And next is this!

672
01:05:53,098 --> 01:05:55,898
奏のぷにぷにクッション！
Kanade's squishy cushion!

673
01:05:55,898 --> 01:05:59,498
まあいっか！寝ている表情のフェイスクッションです！
Oh well! It's a face cushion with a sleeping expression!

674
01:05:59,498 --> 01:06:03,898
特別に奏のほっぺをぷにぷにしてよしと台本に書かれていますが、
The script says, "You may squish Kanade's cheeks as a special treat,"

675
01:06:03,898 --> 01:06:07,898
許可した覚えはありません！
but I have no memory of approving that!

676
01:06:07,898 --> 01:06:10,698
ぷにぷにじゃないからな！
They aren't squishy, okay?!

677
01:06:10,698 --> 01:06:11,498
はい！
Alright!

678
01:06:11,498 --> 01:06:14,398
そして、フルセット購入特典はこちら！
And here is the full-set purchase bonus!

679
01:06:14,398 --> 01:06:19,598
なんと奏、直筆サイン＆箔押し複製メッセージ入りポストカード！
A postcard with Kanade's handwritten signature and foil-stamped printed message!

680
01:06:19,598 --> 01:06:25,698
今回数量限定ではないので、フルセットを買ってくれた方全員に直筆サインが届きます！
It's not limited quantity this time, so everyone who buys the full set will receive a handwritten signature!

681
01:06:25,698 --> 01:06:29,998
みんな安心してね！戦争じゃないからゆっくり買ってもいいんだぞ！
Rest assured, everyone! It's not a war, so you can take your time buying!

682
01:06:29,998 --> 01:06:33,398
奏腱鞘炎になりながら書くからね！
Kanade will write them all even if she gets tendonitis!

683
01:06:33,398 --> 01:06:35,598
うわぁ、頑張って書くぞ！
Whoa, I'll do my best writing them!

684
01:06:35,598 --> 01:06:40,098
今回は、誕生日記念2025お礼ボイスも付きまーす！
This time, it also comes with a Birthday Celebration 2025 Thank-You Voice!

685
01:06:40,098 --> 01:06:47,898
さらに、フルセット特典として昨年の9月から発売された、ホロライブ公式カードゲームで使用できるカードが1枚付きます！
Furthermore, as a full-set bonus, you get one card usable in the hololive OFFICIAL CARD GAME on sale since last September!

686
01:06:47,898 --> 01:06:53,798
カードはホロライブプロダクション公式ショップで購入された方のみ対象となります。
Note that the card is only for those who purchase from the hololive production official shop.

687
01:06:53,798 --> 01:06:55,898
うわー！可愛い！
Whoa, so cute!

688
01:06:55,898 --> 01:07:00,698
特典につくのは推しアピールできるキーカード、推しホロメンカードです！
The bonus is an "Oshi Holomen Card," a key card to show off your favorite talent!

689
01:07:00,698 --> 01:07:04,998
カードの詳細や遊び方についてはホームページにてご確認ください！
Please check the official website for card details and how to play!

690
01:07:04,998 --> 01:07:08,698
カードは日本語版のみとなりますのでご了承ください！
Please note that the card is only available in Japanese!

691
01:07:08,698 --> 01:07:10,998
以上、グッズ紹介でした！
That concludes the merch showcase!

692
01:07:10,998 --> 01:07:13,998
そして告知2つ目はこちら！
And here is the second announcement!

693
01:07:13,998 --> 01:07:18,998
なんと！LINEスタンプ制作決定！すごーい！
LINE stickers are officially in production! Awesome!

694
01:07:18,998 --> 01:07:23,898
可愛いでしょ？「すまそー」って。「すまそー」って言ってる。パチパチありがとー！
Isn't it cute? Saying "Suma-so" (sorry). She's saying "Suma-so." Thanks for the clapping!

695
01:07:23,898 --> 01:07:26,898
えっと...
Um...

696
01:07:26,898 --> 01:07:32,598
発売日はまだ未定ですが、こんな感じの可愛いイラストのスタンプです！イェーイ！
The release date is still undecided, but they're cute illustrated stickers like this! Yay!

697
01:07:32,598 --> 01:07:37,598
セリフとかもね、奏が考えて作ってもらっているので乞うご期待！
Kanade came up with the lines and everything, so please look forward to them!

698
01:07:37,598 --> 01:07:42,698
詳細は後日また告知をします！お楽しみに！
Details will be announced at a later date! Stay tuned!

699
01:07:42,698 --> 01:07:44,398
以上、告知でしたー！
That's all for the announcements!

700
01:07:44,398 --> 01:07:46,198
ということで！
And with that!

701
01:07:46,198 --> 01:07:50,198
音乃瀬奏生誕祭2025、あ、違う、こっちだ！
Otonose Kanade Birthday Festival 2025—ah wait, this way!

702
01:07:50,198 --> 01:07:52,698
毎回間違える、2025！
I always get it wrong—2025!

703
01:07:52,698 --> 01:07:55,198
はい、いかがでしたでしょうかー？
Well, how did you all enjoy it?

704
01:07:55,198 --> 01:07:58,498
初めてのね、アコギの挑戦だったり、
Between my first attempt at acoustic guitar,

705
01:07:58,498 --> 01:08:01,198
ね、「すごいかっこいい！」ってコメントしてくれたの見たよー！
and seeing comments saying "So cool!", I saw them!

706
01:08:01,198 --> 01:08:05,698
嬉しかったし、すごい頑張って準備したので、
It made me so happy, and I worked really hard preparing,

707
01:08:05,698 --> 01:08:08,898
あの、いっぱい見ていただけて嬉しい限りです！
so I'm beyond thrilled that so many of you watched!

708
01:08:08,898 --> 01:08:13,198
本当に嬉しいよ！オリ曲も公開できて！
I'm really so happy! Getting to reveal my original song too!

709
01:08:13,198 --> 01:08:16,998
あの、リリースされたらいっぱい聴いてね！
Please listen to it a lot once it's released!

710
01:08:16,998 --> 01:08:20,998
すごい、まだコメント欄がぷにぷにのくだりになってる(笑)
Wow, the comments are still stuck on the "squishy" part, haha.

711
01:08:20,998 --> 01:08:24,998
遅ぇんだよ！予測して打て！拾えねぇだろ！
You're too slow! Predict it and type! How am I supposed to read it in time?!

712
01:08:24,998 --> 01:08:26,698
えー、ということで、
Um, so anyway,

713
01:08:26,698 --> 01:08:31,198
えー、この後のスケジュールをちょっとざっくり皆さんに教えしますと、
to give you all a quick overview of the schedule after this,

714
01:08:31,198 --> 01:08:35,598
21時10分からグッズ販売開始を行います！
merch sales will begin at 21:10!

715
01:08:35,598 --> 01:08:39,198
そして、21時20分から、あ、こっちだ、
And from 21:20—ah, this way—

716
01:08:39,198 --> 01:08:42,698
20分からメンバーシップ限定の
from 21:20, we have the membership-only

717
01:08:42,698 --> 01:08:45,998
アンコールライブもありますので、そちらもよろしくお願いします！
encore stream, so please look forward to that too!

718
01:08:45,998 --> 01:08:48,998
今がメン限買い時だよ、みんな！
Now's the best time to join the membership, everyone!

719
01:08:48,998 --> 01:08:51,698
今、今今！今入んな！はい！
Now, right now! Join now! Alright!

720
01:08:51,698 --> 01:08:56,698
そして、多分もう終わりかな？忘れてないよね？
And... that should be everything? I haven't forgotten anything, right?

721
01:08:56,698 --> 01:09:00,198
はい、ということで、では！おつ奏でしたー！
Okay, with that, thanks for watching—otsu-Kanade!

722
01:09:00,198 --> 01:09:02,698
来てくれてありがとうー！イェーイ！
Thank you so much for coming! Yay!

723
01:09:02,698 --> 01:09:06,698
あ、待って待って待って！待って待って待って！待って待って！
Ah, wait wait wait! Wait wait wait! Wait wait!

724
01:09:06,698 --> 01:09:09,398
1個、大事なの忘れてた！
I forgot one important thing!

725
01:09:09,398 --> 01:09:12,698
一番大事なお知らせ！はい、告知！
The most important announcement! Yes, announcement!

726
01:09:12,698 --> 01:09:16,198
それでは、みなさん聴いてください。奏からの、
Now then, everyone please listen. From Kanade,

727
01:09:16,198 --> 01:09:21,698
もう、オリ曲並みに大事なお知らせ！
an announcement just as important as an original song!

728
01:09:21,698 --> 01:09:25,998
デデン！あしたは月曜日！
Ta-da! Tomorrow is Monday!

729
01:09:25,998 --> 01:09:30,198
月曜日...月曜日...るるるるる...
Monday... Monday... Lurururu...

730
01:09:30,198 --> 01:09:35,998
みんな夢から覚める時間だよー。もう夢から覚める時間だよー。
It's time for everyone to wake up from the dream. Time to wake up from the dream now.

731
01:09:35,998 --> 01:09:40,698
奏の生誕ライブは、アンコールライブが終わったらもう終わりなんだよー。えーん。
Once the encore live ends, Kanade's birthday live is all over. Waaah.

732
01:09:40,698 --> 01:09:44,698
明日は学校だね、会社だね。えーん。
Tomorrow is school, or work. Waaah.

733
01:09:45,198 --> 01:09:53,698
見てくれてありがとうー！やっと夢に向けた一歩踏み出せました！私はもっともっと輝きたい！
[Text] Thank you for watching! I've finally taken a step toward my dream! I want to shine even brighter!

734
01:09:53,698 --> 01:10:02,698
夢に描いた夢を全部叶えたい！もっと素敵な景色を見せられるようにがんばります！押忍！ 音乃瀬奏
[Text] I want to make all the dreams I pictured come true! I'll work hard to show you even greater sights! Osu! - Otonose Kanade

735
01:10:04,173 --> 01:12:10,201
Error processing subtitles for this segment.

